 "text": "Log in\nSubscribe\nHome\nPosts\nHow to Get Paid for deploying AI\nHow to Get Paid for deploying AI \n\nA free training on what to sell, where the clients are, and what to charge.\n\nSep 18, 2026\n\n•\n\n1 min read\n\nI ran a live training this week on how to start and scale an AI agency, and enough people asked for it afterwards that I'm sending it to the whole list.\n\nIt's free. You can watch the whole thing here.\n\nWatch the training →\n\nHere's what I cover in it:\n\nThe four AI services that are actually selling right now, and what each one pays\n\nWhere the real opportunity is at the moment, which is not where most people are looking\n\nThe simplest path to your first client when you have no portfolio and no case studies\n\nHow to pick a niche, and which ones to stay away from\n\nThe mistakes that lose sales calls, and what to say instead\n\nHow to turn one client into repeat business instead of starting from zero every month\n\nMost people in this space are stuck on the wrong problem. They're learning another tool, building another demo, waiting to feel ready. The thing standing between them and a paying client is the offer: what you sell, who you sell it to, and what you charge.\n\nGet that right and the rest is mechanical. A speed-to-lead and ads system runs about $2,000 to $4,000 a month. A cold email offer runs a monthly fee plus $200 to $400 per qualified call that shows up. Neither one needs you to be technical.\n\nIf you already know which offer you want to run and you want someone to check it before you spend a month on outreach, book a call with my team and we'll go through it.\n\nThe training is about 90 minutes and there's nothing to buy inside it.\n\nWatch the training →\n\nNick\n\nP.S. If you watch one part, make it the section on the four offers. That's the piece that decides whether the next three months turn into a client or another folder of demos. It starts early in the training.\n\nKeep Reading\n\nAug 13, 2026\n\n•\n\n2 min read\n\nWhat you'll walk out with on Monday\n\nThe 3-Day AI Business Launch Challenge.\n\nJul 29, 2026\n\n•\n\n4 min read\n\nAI hasn't paid off in your business yet. Your industry isn't the reason.\n\n$340K at one firm. $210K at another. Two builds with nothing in common.\n\nAug 12, 2026\n\n•\n\n3 min read\n\nStarting an AI business? This one's for you\n\nThe 3-Day AI Business Launch Challenge starts Monday.\n\nView more\nThe AI Core\n\nThis free newsletter is how you win the AI era.\n\nSubscribe\n© 2026 The AI Core.\nPowered by beehiiv\nLog in\nSubscribe",
